        "original_id": "49ac98b3-2d0b-5c3f-b666-d2f06678b6d0",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Aadesh Shrivastava, Shankar Mahadevan, Pritam, Himesh Reshammiya, Abhijeet Bhattacharya, Alka Yagnik, Lalit Pandit, Jatin Pandit\n- TV Shows: Sa Re Ga Ma Pa Challenge 2009, STAR Voice of India\n- Places: Kokilaben Hospital\n\nFacts:\n- In Sa Re Ga Ma Pa Challenge 2009, Aadesh Shrivastava, Shankar Mahadevan, and Pritam joined as new mentors.\n- In Sa Re Ga Ma Pa Challenge 2009, Himesh Reshammiya returned after being a judge in the previous edition.\n- STAR Voice of India featured judges from the Sa Re Ga Ma Pa series, including Aadesh Shrivastava, Abhijeet Bhattacharya, Alka Yagnik, Lalit Pandit, and Jatin Pandit.\n- Aadesh Shrivastava died of cancer at Kokilaben Hospital one day after turning 51.",
